{"content":[{"c":["ZACCUR"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Reubenite and father of Shammua, one of the 12 spies in the reconnaissance of Canaan (",{"href":"?bref=Num.13.4","r":"Num.13.4","rawR":"Num.13.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.13.4","value":"Num.13.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 13:4"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Simeonite who was the son of Hammuel and the father of Shimei (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.26","r":"1Chr.4.26","rawR":"1Chr.4.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.26","value":"1Chr.4.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. One of the descendants of Merari in the record of the divisions of the priests (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.27","r":"1Chr.24.27","rawR":"1Chr.24.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.27","value":"1Chr.24.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. One of the sons of Asaph who was assigned responsibility for the temple service (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.2","r":"1Chr.25.2","rawR":"1Chr.25.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.2","value":"1Chr.25.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:2"},"). Zaccur and his sons and brothers were assigned the third lot among the various duties for the temple musicians (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.25.10","r":"1Chr.25.10","rawR":"1Chr.25.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.25.10","value":"1Chr.25.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 25:10"},"). Descendants of Zaccur were present at the dedication of the city wall following the exile (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.35","r":"Neh.12.35","rawR":"Neh.12.35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.35","value":"Neh.12.35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 12:35"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of the descendants of Bigvai who returned to Jerusalem with Ezra (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.14","r":"Ezra.8.14","rawR":"Ezra.8.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.14","value":"Ezra.8.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:14"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Son of Imri who worked on repairing Jerusalem’s wall in the vicinity of the Sheep Gate (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.2","r":"Neh.3.2","rawR":"Neh.3.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.2","value":"Neh.3.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:2"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["7. One of the Levites who signed Nehemiah’s covenant to obey the law of God (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.12","r":"Neh.10.12","rawR":"Neh.10.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.12","value":"Neh.10.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 10:12"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["8. Son of Mattaniah and father of Hanan, the assistant to the storehouse treasurers during Nehemiah’s time (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.13.13","r":"Neh.13.13","rawR":"Neh.13.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.13.13","value":"Neh.13.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 13:13"},"). Some have suggested that he is the same as #7 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Zaccur","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 13:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.13.4","rawQueryValue":"Num.13.4","sourceRefExact":"Num.13.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.26"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.27","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.27","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.2","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.2","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.2"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 25:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.25.10","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.25.10","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.25.10"},{"anchorText":"Neh 12:35","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.35","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.35","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.35"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 8:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.8.14","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.8.14","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.8.14"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.2","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.2","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.2"},{"anchorText":"Neh 10:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.12","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.12","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.12"},{"anchorText":"Neh 13:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.13.13","rawQueryValue":"Neh.13.13","sourceRefExact":"Neh.13.13"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0f20faa652bbf3dc2054e8f0f045f7a307ccbe4db2d32e0254fe020e5cb25021","sourceItemName":"Zaccur","sourceItemOrder":15,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Zaccur","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zaccur","title":"Zaccur","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}